43f?download\" data-file-name=\"KakaoTalk_20211008_132803434_08.jpg\" data-file-size=\"217295\" data-mimetype=\"image/jpeg\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D513%26fileid%3D9%26regdt%3D20211008133514&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F75ec5e263b6374898f46389e5e57892016f6143f')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">KakaoTalk_20211008_132803434_08</span><span class=\"type\">.jpg</span></div><div class=\"size\">212.20KB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">수업자료 및 사진자료 업로드할테니 필요하신분은 얼마든지 활용하세요.<br>글씨는 메이플스토리 otf 이므로 글꼴이 없을경우 파일이 깨집니다.</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/868379d5c53250e96c6864191fdecd6433882699?download\" data-file-name=\"6-1-2.밀도(4) 밀도탑쌓기.hwp\" data-file-size=\"1971712\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D513%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20211008133514&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F868379d5c53250e96c6864191fdecd6433882699')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">6-1-2.밀도(4) 밀도탑쌓기</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">1.88MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ac65eee243d5b539c3d8789aac7c9db3d4fccec4?download\" data-file-name=\"6-1-2.밀도(4) 밀도탑쌓기.show\" data-file-size=\"5623459\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansoftshow\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D513%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20211008133514&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fac65eee243d5b539c3d8789aac7c9db3d4fccec4')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename